<item><title>TSMC gains $158 billion in value in one day as Jensen Huang returns as Nvidia CEO</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/11/24/tsmc-gains-158-billion-in-value-in-one-day-as-jensen-huang-returns-as-nvidia-ceo/</link><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 07:05:56 +0000</pubDate><dcterms:modified>2026-11-24T02:26:23-05:00</dcterms:modified><updated>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 07:26:23 +0000</updated><dc:creator>Jay Ganglani</dc:creator><category>Asia</category><category domain="fortune-section" level="parent">Latest</category><category domain="fortune-section" level="child">Asia</category><guid isPermaLink="false">https://fortune.com/?p=4649568&#038;showAdminBar=true</guid><description><![CDATA[The rally clawed back part of a 17.5% weekly slide in Taipei, the worst since 1991, that had forced regulators to curb short selling.]]></description><media:content url="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/GettyImages-2260737267-e1795503471942.jpg?w=2048" type="image/jpeg" medium="image"><media:thumbnail url="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/GettyImages-2260737267-e1795503471942.jpg?w=300"/><media:credit>Jimmy Beunardeau—Hans Lucas / AFP via Getty Images</media:credit><media:description>Taiwan Semiconductor Manufacturing Co. (TSMC), which makes Nvidia’s chips, surged 9.9%—the daily limit—adding 5.2 trillion New Taiwan dollars ($158 billion) to its market value in a single day.</media:description></media:content></item><item><title>A selloff, a POTUS, or a recession: What really made Nvidia bring Jensen Huang back as CEO?</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/11/23/why-did-nvidia-jensen-huang-return-market-selloff-government-intervention-recession-worries/</link><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 00:44:50 +0000</pubDate><dcterms:modified>2026-11-23T20:43:08-05:00</dcterms:modified><updated>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 01:43:08 +0000</updated><dc:creator>Morgan Chittum</dc:creator><category>Big Tech</category><category domain="fortune-section" level="parent">Tech</category><category domain="fortune-section" level="child">Big Tech</category><guid isPermaLink="false">https://fortune.com/?p=4649466&#038;showAdminBar=true</guid><description><![CDATA[As investors and Huang fans celebrated, broader questions loomed over Monday’s stunning sequence of events.]]></description><media:content url="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/GettyImages-2277921666-e1795471738230.jpg?w=2048" type="image/jpeg" medium="image"><media:thumbnail url="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/GettyImages-2277921666-e1795471738230.jpg?w=300"/><media:credit>AN RONG XU—Bloomberg/Getty Images</media:credit><media:description>Jensen Huang was reinstated as Nvidia CEO on Monday, less than two weeks after he resigned. </media:description><media:title type="html"> <![CDATA[Nvidia CEO Jensen Huang smiling ]]></media:title></media:content></item><item><title>As FEMA pushes recovery onto states, a Miami startup pitches an AI case manager for disaster survivors</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/11/23/aidfinder-ai-disaster-recovery-palisades-fire-nostrant/</link><pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 08:03:00 +0000</pubDate><dcterms:modified>2026-11-23T20:30:19-05:00</dcterms:modified><updated>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 01:30:19 +0000</updated><dc:creator>Heather Occhino</dc:creator><category>Startups &amp; Venture</category><category domain="fortune-section" level="parent">Tech</category><category domain="fortune-section" level="child">Startups &amp; Venture</category><guid isPermaLink="false">https://fortune.com/?p=4648162&#038;showAdminBar=true</guid><description><![CDATA[Miami-based AidFinder uses AI to match survivors with aid programs and prepare their applications. Its pitch lands as FEMA pushes states to own more of recovery.]]></description><media:content url="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/founderof-aidfinder-startup.png?w=2048" type="image/jpeg" medium="image"><media:thumbnail url="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/founderof-aidfinder-startup.png?w=300"/><media:credit>Courtesy of Aidfinder</media:credit><media:description>After the Palisades fire, Jonathon Nostrant built AidFinder, an AI platform for disaster aid.</media:description></media:content></item><item><title>Trump’s ‘assurance’ to Nvidia’s board over national security: Protection from a major source of legal danger?</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/11/23/trump-assurance-to-nvidia-board-over-national-security-legal-threats/</link><pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 21:25:13 +0000</pubDate><dcterms:modified>2026-11-23T20:06:08-05:00</dcterms:modified><updated>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 01:06:08 +0000</updated><dc:creator>Sasha Rogelberg</dc:creator><category>Big Tech</category><category domain="fortune-section" level="parent">Tech</category><category domain="fortune-section" level="child">Big Tech</category><guid isPermaLink="false">https://fortune.com/?p=4649165&#038;showAdminBar=true</guid><description><![CDATA[A White House spokesperson confirmed Trump’s role to Fortune: “President Trump was totally involved … We have to protect our geniuses.”]]></description><media:content url="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/GettyImages-2297774940_c2183f-e1795467728359.jpg?w=2048" type="image/jpeg" medium="image"><media:thumbnail url="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/GettyImages-2297774940_c2183f-e1795467728359.jpg?w=300"/><media:credit>Kevin Dietsch—Getty Images</media:credit><media:description>President Donald Trump confirmed he played a role in Jensen Huang’s reinstatement as Nvidia CEO.</media:description><media:title type="html"> <![CDATA[Jensen Huang shakes Donald Trump&#039;s hand. ]]></media:title></media:content></item><item><title>The 11 days that brought Jensen Huang back to Nvidia</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/11/23/the-11-days-that-brought-jensen-huang-back-to-nvidia/</link><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 00:07:15 +0000</pubDate><dcterms:modified>2026-11-23T19:07:32-05:00</dcterms:modified><updated>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 00:07:32 +0000</updated><dc:creator>Sebastian Herrera</dc:creator><category>Big Tech</category><category domain="fortune-section" level="parent">Tech</category><category domain="fortune-section" level="child">Big Tech</category><guid isPermaLink="false">https://fortune.com/?p=4649058&#038;showAdminBar=true</guid><description><![CDATA[Nvidia’s board reinstated Huang as CEO, the company announced Monday. ]]></description><media:content url="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/GettyImages-2299110515-e1795464871850.jpg?w=2048" type="image/jpeg" medium="image"><media:thumbnail url="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/GettyImages-2299110515-e1795464871850.jpg?w=300"/><media:credit>Heather Diehl/Getty Images</media:credit><media:description>Reinstated Nvidia CEO Jensen Huang. </media:description></media:content></item></channel></rss>